        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "It was so, that when any man came near to bow down to him, he stretched out his hand, took hold of him, and kissed him.",
      "ko": "사람이 가까이 와서 절하려 하면 압살롬이 손을 펴서 그 사람을 붙들고 입을 맞추니",
      "source_text_hash": "4e59ec59fff59746d7a0c5c6e28f8a9729f278d89e76f3cad599d148f9b727c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f15f06f50589eda36c742dc41173c40d41cb027c76643969c08003075b7ad5dc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사람이 가까이 와서 절하려 하면 압살롬이 손을 펴서 그 사람을 붙들고 입을 맞추니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f15f06f50589eda36c742dc41173c40d41cb027c76643969c08003075b7ad5dc"
      ]
