      "en": "The king went out, and all the people after him; and they stayed in Beth Merhak.",
      "ko": "왕이 나가매 모든 백성이 다 따라서 벧메르학에 이르러 머무니",
      "source_text_hash": "b3d9cae1ac2601a9fcf755a5248c9b94c6011cf501c82b5aee4ca2eb2c357624",
      "translation_text_hash": "02cf563d0101f0373d674e02471606c5cc11700f5ae2be56c8ba6ebdb9444208",
