      "en": "All the country wept with a loud voice, and all the people passed over. The king also himself passed over the brook Kidron, and all the people passed over toward the way of the wilderness.",
      "ko": "온 땅 사람이 대성통곡하며 모든 인민이 앞서 건너가매 왕도 기드론 시내를 건너가니 건너간 모든 백성이 광야 길로 향하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4c4aae8039c564d7758603dc6e9dc818a9804e92836b51e14df639394f6af718",
      "translation_text_hash": "5203b6afba7df2ed179ea8191daaa0155c956ab539de48f69dad0f454e323674",
