      "en": "David went up by the ascent of the Mount of Olives, and wept as he went up; and he had his head covered and went barefoot. All the people who were with him each covered his head, and they went up, weeping as they went up.",
      "ko": "다윗이 감람산 길로 올라갈 때에 머리를 가리우고 맨발로 울며 행하고 저와 함께 가는 백성들도 각각 그 머리를 가리우고 울며 올라가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "eebaf698cbdeb3f4ee73b7234a3c5758282452001fb7a8b28cde55b3fc878216",
      "translation_text_hash": "0a92e77569e78c9e45365ff07c21c02ba2e029062e83491c8738dbdc896b2bd9",
