      "en": "When David had come to the top, where God was worshiped, behold, Hushai the Archite came to meet him with his tunic torn and earth on his head.",
      "ko": "다윗이 하나님을 경배하는 마루턱에 이를 때에 아렉 사람 후새가 옷을 찢고 흙을 머리에 무릅쓰고 다윗을 맞으러 온지라",
      "source_text_hash": "daf6eca957166bf6c6a7c1dbfb3e8d11737e37cb7df3832115eb19c91ea6d7de",
